  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MICROORGANISMS AND METHODS FOR THE PRODUCTION OF FATTY ACIDS AND FATTY ACID DERIVED PRODUCTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"This technology involves the use of microorganisms to produce fatty acids and their derivatives, offering a more sustainable, efficient, and cost-effective alternative to traditional methods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Rodriguez is a leading expert in microbiology and biotechnology, involved in groundbreaking patent filings and research on microorganisms and fatty acid production."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. JOHN TAYLOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. John Taylor is a renowned expert in biotechnology and sustainability, involved in research on microorganisms and fatty acid production."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF CALIFORNIA, BERKELEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of California, Berkeley is the institution where Dr. Maria Rodriguez and her team conducted research on microorganisms and fatty acid production."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of California, Berkeley is the institution where the groundbreaking research on microorganisms and volcanic eruptions was conducted."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OMEGA-3 FATTY ACIDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Omega-3 fatty acids are essential for human health and can be increased by up to 50% using the novel method described in the patent filing."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US PATENT 11408013&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"US Patent 11408013 is the patent filing for 'Microorganisms and methods for the production of fatty acids and fatty acid derived products', representing a major milestone in the field of fatty acid production."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOD INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The food industry is one of the sectors that could benefit from the new technology, as it offers a more sustainable and efficient method for producing fatty acids and their derivatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COSMETICS INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The cosmetics industry is another sector that could benefit from the new technology, as it offers a more sustainable and efficient method for producing fatty acids and their derivatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PHARMACEUTICALS INDUSTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The pharmaceuticals industry is yet another sector that could benefit from the new technology, as it offers a more sustainable and efficient method for producing fatty acids and their derivatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VOLCANIC ERUPTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Volcanic eruptions are natural events that can be influenced by the presence of microorganisms producing fatty acids."&lt;SEP&gt;"Volcanic eruptions are the natural phenomenon being studied in relation to microorganisms and fatty acid production."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FATTYBACILLUS VOLCANICUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fattybacillus volcanicus is a newly discovered species of bacteria that produces a unique fatty acid profile and plays a crucial role in volcanic eruptions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nature is the scientific journal in which the groundbreaking research on microorganisms and volcanic eruptions was published."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF CAMBRIDGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Cambridge is an educational institution where Dr. Sophia Patel works and conducts research."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Cambridge is an institution where Dr. Sophia Patel, a volcanologist, works and expresses excitement about the research findings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GROUNDBREAKING PATENT FILING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The groundbreaking patent filing represents a major milestone in the field of fatty acid production, offering a more sustainable, efficient, and cost-effective alternative to traditional methods."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MICROBIAL FERMENTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Microbial fermentation is the novel approach described in the patent filing for producing fatty acids and their derivatives using microorganisms."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0390</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABILITY&quot;">
